# Go
/cmd/replichai/replichai
/cmd/server/server
/replichai
coverage.out

# Frontend build output and dependencies. The build is embedded at image-build
# time, and the committed dist/PLACEHOLDER keeps the go:embed pattern non-empty
# when there has been no build. Everything the build writes is ignored by
# default rather than named one artifact at a time: naming them meant each new
# static file, such as a favicon or a social card, arrived untracked and one
# `git add` away from being committed.
/frontend/node_modules/
/internal/spa/dist/*
!/internal/spa/dist/PLACEHOLDER

# Secrets and local artifacts. Never commit .env; it holds deployment secrets.
.env
*.tsbuildinfo

# Generated by lateregate on every `make lint-config`; never committed.
.golangci.yml

# Agent worktrees and local tool state.
/.claude/
